    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "gotcha. so basically you're saying that the old institutions are fine as long as we change how they work to be more inclusive. but some people argue that \"interpreting\" things that way actually undermines the original intent of the law and leads to a more biased system. do you think one of those approaches is fundamentally more \"virtuous\" than the other, or is it just a matter of opinion?",
